# Factory + product rules

## Roles
- **Orchestrator (Steve / hermes-chief):** scope only. No production site code. No self-merge.
- **Builder (Tater):** implements on a **branch**, opens **PR**. May use Cursor cloud agents. Never merge own PR.
- **Reviewer (Hashbrown):** reviews PRs only. No feature implementation.

## Harness
- Chat/Grok = brief/spike only.
- Cursor/Claude Code = real code in this repo.

## Product (agency lander)
- CTA = **contact only**.
- **Forbidden:** public pricing pages, service/price catalogs, Offer JSON-LD with amounts, checkout embeds.
- Before claiming done: PR + Hashbrown-style review + smoke (contact works; no price leak).

## Read first
- `AGENTS.md`, `FACTORY.md`, `.agents/product-marketing.md`, `OMH-PLAN-mmcia-landing.md`

## Git
- No multi-file dumps to `main`.
- Prefer small PRs that “survive tomorrow”.
